<title>JAPAN: Summers to meet media in Japan at 0730 GMT Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Summers to meet media in Japan at 0730 GMT Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Deputy Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers will hold a news conference in Tokyo at 4.30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on Tuesday, financial sources said.</p>
<p>Summers will be attending the so-called &quot;Six Markets Meeting&quot; of senior finance and central bank officials from the United States, Japan, Singapore, Hong Kong, China and Australia that day.</p>
<p>He will also hold bilateral talks with Japanese officials including Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka.</p>
</text>
